# Wings of Gold (jeuno 60): Brutus in Upper Jeuno, the Treasure Chests of Middle and Upper Delkfutt's Tower. A level
# 40 beastmaster with Path of the Beastmaster completed: Brutus's 139 (option 0: Prog 1), 137 (option 0: nothing;
# option 1: begun), Brutus while accepted without the bell (136; Path of the Beastmaster's completed 20 has the same
# Event priority, so the lookup cycles the two, 20 first by container order, his silent script's turns falling back to
# the next one), the Middle tower chest without the bell (the treasure trade with the key item bypass gives the
# Guiding Bell; noAction), the Upper tower chest with the bell (nil: the chest's own script, a regular opening),
# Brutus's 138 (a full bag: not completed, the bell kept; with room: completed, Barbaroi Axe, fame +7 x3, the bell
# deleted), then completed: Wings' 134 (replaceDefault) loses to Path of the Beastmaster's Event 20 in the lookup, and
# Brutus's script plays 134 on its turns (Wings completed); then a GM completes Scattered into Shadow (check 3 false:
# Path's 20, and the script's 151). A bone chip traded to Brutus while offered: no trade handler, nil.
# Chests: placed 10 s after the zone loads (tick 13000), the key item 2 s after the trade (tick 4500).
lists UpperJeuno/Brutus/onTrigger MiddleDelkfuttsTower/Treasure_Chest/onTrade UpperDelkfuttsTower/Treasure_Chest/onTrade UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/137 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/139 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/138
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-55.5,8.2,97.5 job=BST lvl=40
quest Jeuno.ChocoboOnTheLoose completed
quest Jeuno.ChocobosWounds completed
quest Jeuno.SaveMySon completed
quest Jeuno.PathOfTheBeastmaster completed
item DelkfuttChestKey x2
item BoneChip
login
trigger Brutus                              # available, Prog 0: 139
finish option=0                             # not 1: Prog 1
trade Brutus BoneChip x1                    # available: no trade handler, nil (his script has none)
trigger Brutus                              # Prog 1: 137
finish option=0                             # not 1: nothing
trigger Brutus                              # 137
finish option=1                             # begun
trigger Brutus                              # accepted, no bell: the lookup's turn, Path of the Beastmaster's 20 first
finish
trigger Brutus                              # the script's turn, silent: the next Event action, 136
finish
warp -40,-47.852,90 MiddleDelkfuttsTower
tick 13000
trigger Treasure_Chest
trade Treasure_Chest DelkfuttChestKey x1    # no bell: the treasure trade, bypass 2: the Guiding Bell; noAction
tick 4500                                   # the Guiding Bell
warp -300,-175.924,20 UpperDelkfuttsTower
tick 13000
trigger Treasure_Chest
trade Treasure_Chest DelkfuttChestKey x1    # the bell held: nil; the chest's own script opens it
tick 4500
warp -55.5,8.2,97.5 UpperJeuno
trigger Brutus                              # the bell: 138
fill-inventory
finish                                      # no room for the axe: not completed, the bell kept
free-inventory
trigger Brutus                              # 138 again
finish                                      # completed: Barbaroi Axe, fame +7 x3, the bell deleted
trigger Brutus                              # completed: Path of the Beastmaster's 20 (Event) outranks Wings' 134 (replaceDefault)
finish
trigger Brutus                              # the script's turn: his 134 (Wings completed)
finish
quest Jeuno.ScatteredIntoShadow completed   # a GM: check 3 false, Wings returns nothing at Brutus
trigger Brutus                              # Path of the Beastmaster's 20 (the lookup's turn)
finish
trigger Brutus                              # the script's turn: his 151 (Scattered completed)
finish
